\"text_14\"><g style=\"fill: #333333\" transform=\"translate(114.527052 81.829024) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><defs><path id=\"LibreFranklin-Regular-e2\" d=\"M 3174 2259 Q 3174 2176 3072 2176 L 480 2170 Q 435 2170 416 2189 Q 397 2208 397 2246 L 397 2522 Q 397 2598 454 2598 L 3110 2598 Q 3174 2598 3174 2534 L 3174 2259 z\nM 1664 998 Q 1574 998 1574 1101 L 1568 3693 Q 1568 3744 1587 3760 Q 1606 3776 1645 3776 L 1920 3776 Q 1997 3776 1997 3718 L 2003 1062 Q 2003 998 1939 998 L 1664 998 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-e2\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-82\" transform=\"translate(55.703125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-a9\" transform=\"translate(115.609375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-82\" transform=\"translate(136.515625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-85\" transform=\"translate(196.421875 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_15\"><g style=\"fill: #333333\" transform=\"translate(183.214844 44.121174) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-e2\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-81\" transform=\"translate(55.703125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-a9\" transform=\"translate(102.203125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-85\" transform=\"translate(123.109375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-85\" transform=\"translate(188.515625 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_16\"><g style=\"fill: #333333\" transform=\"translate(251.67076 14.928) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-e2\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-81\" transform=\"translate(55.703125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-a9\" transform=\"translate(102.203125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-82\" transform=\"translate(123.109375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-80\" transform=\"translate(183.015625 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_17\"><g style=\"fill: #333333\" transform=\"translate(321.346677 14.928) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-85\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-a9\" transform=\"translate(65.40625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-88\" transform=\"translate(86.3125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-86\" transform=\"translate(153.109375 0)\"/></g></g></g></g><defs><clipPath id=\"p1ea1cd105e\"><rect x=\"20.391719\" y=\"9.768\" width=\"345.96\" height=\"149.688\"/></clipPath></defs></svg>\n","title":"Exhibit 1 · Contribution per order ($)","note":null},"answer":"<ul><li><b>Batch orders</b> (two orders per courier trip, cutting courier cost 30%): +$2.25 → $3.11</li> <li><b>Bigger baskets</b> ($45 → $55 via a minimum order and suggestions): +$1.55 → $4.66</li> <li><b>Cut promotions</b> to $0.80 by targeting them at new customers only: +$1.20 → <b>$5.86</b></li></ul> <p>With all three: $5.86 × 1.2M = <b>$7.0M</b>, above the $6M of fixed costs.</p>"},{"q":"What could stop this working?","exhibit":null,"answer":"<ul><li>Batching may slow deliveries, LeafCart's main selling point; offer a cheaper 'within 2 hours' option</li> <li>A minimum basket may push away small top-up orders</li><li>Cutting promotions could slow growth; measure repeat rates by cohort</li></ul>"}],"reco":"LeafCart can become profitable, but not through volume: it earns only $0.86 an order, so it would need about 5.8× today's orders to cover fixed costs. Batching deliveries, raising the average basket to $55 and targeting promotions at new customers would lift contribution to about $5.86 an order, about $7.0M a year against $6M of fixed costs. Risk: slower or less convenient delivery. Next step: trial batching and a minimum basket in two neighbourhoods.","great":["Builds contribution per order line by line","Shows that volume alone can't fix it","Sizes each lever in dollars per order","Checks the result against fixed costs"],"id":72,"slug":"leafcart"}